  "project_description": "This module is a fork of the Drimage module and should work as a drop-in replacement, however, it uses system file paths and falls back on the dynamic generation.\n\nFor more info, please check the original issue https://www.drupal.org/project/drimage/issues/3283460 \n\n Post-Installation \n The module will disable Drimage and update the field formatters to use the new widget.\n\nIf using files to manage your configuration you will need to export the files and commit it to your version control repository.\n\n Similar projects \n Drimage \n\n Back to top",
